      "text": "The flop texture tells you how much can change."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.125,
      "end": 10.625,
      "text": "A dry board like ace-seven-two has fewer draws and fewer strong connections, so small pressure works often."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.625,
      "end": 13.75,
      "text": "A wet board like jack-ten-nine is different."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.75,
      "end": 19.833333333333332,
      "text": "It creates pairs, straights, two pairs, combo draws, and pressure points everywhere."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.833333333333332,
      "end": 24.708333333333332,
      "text": "When the board smashes the caller’s range, autopilot betting gets punished."
